Package: com.vo1dek.wipecode-pref
Name: WipeCode (Settings pane)
Version: 1.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Adds the WipeCode pane to Settings. Prompts for the wipe password, derives its keyboard from the device passcode type published by the SpringBoard half, and sends the authenticated erase request. The erase call itself is still being verified against this iOS build; check probe.log before trusting it.
Depends: mobilesubstrate, com.vo1dek.wipecode-sb
Maintainer: dassd <dassd@localhost>
Author: dassd
Section: Tweaks
Tag: role::hacker
